    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani ghoang'eat gichea ghwadeasta gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeaksa soomjoagaaschi Hirameeda was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Diro heeda Sulemani damanda nyasa iita gideaba siimbiit ghoah sugoocheanda gawa hoorgeeda ghwaan; aba gideaba Hiramu ghabwariiy Dawdi galeagasean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta Sulemani siida ghwaat ng'asheanda heeda Hiramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ang'iing'i ginali gideaba Dawdeeda was bwaabwa mayghoamu ghwadeas gheeda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI aba ng'asheega ng'ucheeda sea weajoodigaaschi neaweesa niny, bwak ea ghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda baneaguuka geeshangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU ea nigoonan fuufeanda aba meatkwajeega sean; mudu gwanda weajoodiga ghana gida muy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa geagasayi dadeas gheeda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi was bwaabwa, ‘Orjeedaang'u, jea danung' goopteadawa hoorgeadaang'u, gayghwadeas gheeda aba gheawungeasu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nung' eelaknean geedigiga was gubooyeeka Lebanoni; ak gaygoodeayi fugeasu bea gadiyeeda sea fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, ak gaydagoonyi gidageatinda bea fugaagu bea gadiyeeda aba gichea nyaashta; aba gideaba ginali aba jeedeanya manda siisi ammu ghabwar beehajeega urji fiisu bea Sidoniin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Hiramu ng'asheega Sulemani, gahoosan muuchi, ak gwayi, “Gagasa eebadiischeesa NG'UTAMIIDA askweareani, adaw Dawdi orjeeda weaghoodiin goombal fiisu saang'aan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeaksa Hiramu Sulemani, ak gwayeesha, “Naayiinyi giijasta iijeaksean; ak geawooschi hidaat aba sinooda gidigasayi was gubooyeeka ea beehajeega mareamboojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygoorareang'na fugeasu bea gadiyeeda Lebaloni ea ghwahita ghuuta basooda; ak gaydarasiinyi ak ghaanung' ghapka aba jeeda basooda ea ghwahita heeda igasayi, ama ng'ata gaydeatineada ak abeeda giimuusi geanda; ak abeeda giweachaan aba giing'aateayda fugeaba gheanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoadaw Hiramu Sulemani beehajeega sean bea gubooyeeka ea mareamboojiga gawuurji gidagasiida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Sulemani niny ghoadaw Hiramu mushoodaw bughalaji diktam bea ngaano ghoah hamiteaba gheanyi, ea mushoodaw bughalaji diktam bea nagheeda simuush. Sulemani ghoadaw Hiramu haleanjeeni gilakweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA weaghuumeeda Sulemani, gawuurji gidaghayi heeleesiinda niny; ak hean ghwanyagaan hoyyoo aba heeda Sulemani ea Hiramu; ak gwasin neajeeda iyeenye nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghoang'eat gwaadi sea fuga jea gwasin gadiyeeda hang'waay aba jeeda fuga sean bea Israeli; ak fuga gadiyeeda hang'waayi ghwahita headi sagalamnyooji diktam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' gaweay Lebanoni fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush jeemba sheanagi aba lageanyeeda; gaygoobiida Lebanoni aba jeemba sheanagi ak sheeh iyeenya gaygoobiida ghoah; ak Adoniramu ghoah siida miineadaysa gwaadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sulemani gwandeawa gicha fih laadam ea damanamughuush eada sareenda ea fih seedam gula lagheanga aba ng'eanyiida heayeeniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean gwanda fih suuk was sagalamnyooji samwagu ea bughalaji samwagu, iin heeda Sulemani ghoah fuga hees jea gamiineadaysa gadiyeeda, was fuga jea gamiineadaysa fuga gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba giidaydeayda diigheanda bea sugoocheanda, geeyeadu lagheanga hees, mideawa sheayeeda haw, ak geayiin gumdooda gheeda lagheanga sing'oora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata deekshoodiga Sulemani ea gea Hiramu ea fuga Gebali gagul lagheanga ak gwasisin beehajeega jea eadeasa gheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
